OL,3,AFood, fuel and taxes ` can the
OL,4,ADemocrats actually make life cheaper?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo business owners, half a country
OL,7,Fapart, want the same thing for
OL,8,Fdifferent reasons.
OL,10,FIn Texas, Kim Hanks, who owns Tillies,
OL,11,Fa hotel, restaurant and spa business
OL,12,Fnear Austin, says rising grocery and
OL,13,Ffuel costs are forcing her to raise
OL,14,Fwages for her 300 staff.
OL,16,F"It's been such a moving target for us
OL,17,Fon affordability," she told the BBC
OL,18,FWorld Service.
